  "body": "https://github.com/whatwg/url/pull/186 made it so that passwords can no longer be null.  In the HTML spec for the HTMLHyperlinkElementUtils interface, step number 3 of the [password](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/semantics.html#dom-hyperlink-password) attribute's getter states:\r\n\r\n> 3. If url or url's password is null, return the empty string.\r\n\r\nThis should probably be rephrased to the following, to be less misleading about the values that a url's password can contain:\r\n> 3. If url is null, return the empty string.",
